  "rationale": "The target is an OR over four branches: vaultRead, shareMount, dbReplica and codeRepo. Blocking ssoLogin:authenticate removes fileServer, which starves secretsManager and so vaultRead. It also removes serviceAccount, which starves dbReplica and codeRepo. shareMount depends only on backupHost:lateralMovement, which is reachable via browserStore (from iotDevice or dmzWeb) or via dbLogin, so blocking backupHost removes that branch. No single step works: the shareMount branch shares no ancestor with the other branches whose removal would cut it, because browserStore is still reachable through iotDevice from entry footholds. So the minimum is 2."
